From: Felipe Paschoal Bergamo <64669985+felipepasc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:22:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] paleta: guardar bloco em 1-2 bits quando a secao so tem 2-4
 valores
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

O mapeamento de bloco promovia bits 1-4 todos pra 4, entao secao com 2 valores
distintos pagava 4 bits por posicao — 4x o necessario. O bioma ja usava 1, 2 e 3
bits, ou seja SimpleBitStorage e o formato sempre suportaram.

Configuration.Narrow separa bitsInMemory de bitsInStorage. pack()/unpack() ja
usavam bitsInStorage, entao o disco continua em 4 bits e nada externo enxerga
diferenca; o unpack cai sozinho no ramo que re-encoda pro estreito. Na rede,
storageForWire() alarga antes de escrever, sem tocar na paleta — os ids ja cabem
em 4 bits, entao nao ha remapeamento.

Preciso alargar porque writeFixedSizeLongArray nao manda tamanho: o cliente
deduz do que espera, e ele mapeia bits 1-4 pra 4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017ThTimkw5e5bmBhCfrK7UQ

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/Configuration.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/Configuration.java
index 3135afe312672accb7fff2484d472469c4fae586..79dc1b63a05df16832a945faee58f233b0eada6c 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/Configuration.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/Configuration.java
@@ -23,6 +23,24 @@ public interface Configuration {
         }
     }
 
+    // RedeFantasy start - narrow block storage
+    /**
+     * Guarda menos bits por posicao do que o formato serializado exige. A paleta e a mesma dos dois
+     * lados, entao alargar na hora de escrever nao remapeia id nenhum.
+     */
+    public record Narrow(Palette.Factory factory, @Override int bitsInMemory, @Override int bitsInStorage) implements Configuration {
+        @Override
+        public boolean alwaysRepack() {
+            return false;
+        }
+
+        @Override
+        public <T> Palette<T> createPalette(Strategy<T> strategy, List<T> values) {
+            return this.factory.create(this.bitsInMemory, values);
+        }
+    }
+    // RedeFantasy end - narrow block storage
+
     public record Simple(Palette.Factory factory, int bits) implements Configuration {
         @Override
         public boolean alwaysRepack() {
diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java
index 07355d76cdb162b2d200c230e2511aca18babed3..1c0db10f876bce3887e72da8d9bf820cd574099e 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java
@@ -484,20 +484,54 @@ public class PalettedContainer<T> implements PaletteResize<T>, PalettedContainer
         }
 
         public int getSerializedSize(IdMap<T> map) {
-            return 1 + this.palette.getSerializedSize(map) + this.storage.getRaw().length * 8;
+            return 1 + this.palette.getSerializedSize(map) + this.serializedLongCount() * 8; // RedeFantasy - narrow block storage
         }
 
+        // RedeFantasy start - narrow block storage
+        /** A copia viva pode ser mais estreita que o formato de fio; quem sai na rede e esta. */
+        private BitStorage storageForWire() {
+            final int bits = this.configuration.bitsInStorage();
+            final BitStorage storage = this.storage;
+
+            if (storage.getBits() == bits) {
+                return storage;
+            }
+
+            final int size = storage.getSize();
+            final BitStorage wide = new SimpleBitStorage(bits, size);
+
+            for (int i = 0; i < size; ++i) {
+                wide.set(i, storage.get(i));
+            }
+
+            return wide;
+        }
+
+        private int serializedLongCount() {
+            final int bits = this.configuration.bitsInStorage();
+
+            if (this.storage.getBits() == bits) {
+                return this.storage.getRaw().length;
+            }
+
+            final int perLong = 64 / bits;
+
+            return (this.storage.getSize() + perLong - 1) / perLong;
+        }
+        // RedeFantasy end - narrow block storage
+
         // Paper start - Anti-Xray - Add chunk packet info
         public void write(FriendlyByteBuf buffer, IdMap<T> map, io.papermc.paper.antixray.@Nullable ChunkPacketInfo<T> chunkPacketInfo, int chunkSectionIndex) {
-            buffer.writeByte(this.storage.getBits());
+            final BitStorage storage = this.storageForWire(); // RedeFantasy - narrow block storage
+            buffer.writeByte(storage.getBits()); // RedeFantasy - narrow block storage
             this.palette.write(buffer, map);
             if (chunkPacketInfo != null) {
-                chunkPacketInfo.setBits(chunkSectionIndex, this.configuration.bitsInMemory());
+                chunkPacketInfo.setBits(chunkSectionIndex, storage.getBits()); // RedeFantasy - narrow block storage
                 chunkPacketInfo.setPalette(chunkSectionIndex, this.palette);
                 chunkPacketInfo.setIndex(chunkSectionIndex, buffer.writerIndex());
             }
             // Paper end - Anti-Xray - Add chunk packet info
-            buffer.writeFixedSizeLongArray(this.storage.getRaw());
+            buffer.writeFixedSizeLongArray(storage.getRaw()); // RedeFantasy - narrow block storage
         }
 
         public PalettedContainer.Data<T> copy() {
diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/Strategy.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/Strategy.java
